  <Control id="Lbl-Sub" type="Label" x="24" y="80" w="1216" h="104" tab-order="0" z-order="0" visible="true" enabled="true">
    <Property name="Caption">An AgentObject is a configured model endpoint. SetPrompt and SetModel change it from COBOL, Ask sends the question, and the reply arrives as onResponse - which reads it back from LastReply. Nothing here needs a network unless you press Ask.

In order to run this example you need a valid API Key to access Ollama (a model provider). Create one at www.ollama.com

After create your own API Key use it to set the AgentControl API KEY property.</Property>
